[thin] The internal webs meet the 1.5 mm minimum at both chamfered faces: drain-to-ribbon 1.5625 mm and flavor-to-drain 1.5764 mm. The straight sections are 2.1625 and 2.3764 mm. The complete pair and exterior measurements and seven STL sections are in integration-check.json. The round beverage/drain contact profiles retain their feature-level physical selection; this centered arrangement and flat ribbon slot are unprinted.
alternatives: More lateral spread needs more exterior stock or further forward placement. More drain/ribbon separation displaces the row along Y from the steel channel. Smaller bore entrances change the selected fit profile. A joined opening removes independent guidance.
